        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86332, Rustic Sandcast Rail Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Bronze Rail Cabinet Pull features the industrial chic look that has gained in popularity over the years. Choose from flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Rustic Sandcast Rail Pull is available in an array of sizes ranging from 3 inches all the way up to 10 inches. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/rail-sandcast-bronze-appliance-pull-emtek-ap-86349\"><b> Rail Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Sandcast Bronze Rail Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86332-specifications.pdf?v=1704262413\"><b>Emtek Sandcast Bronze Rail Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Available in 6 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86332:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86333:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86334:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86335:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86438:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>